# Sala 5 de la Liga (the champion = the rival, C9, contract 56), 11 x 12, interior, ONE room of the League four run (contract 50.2): CHAMPION: marble, the banner walls (the crown on a hanging banner), PixelLab fluted columns and trophies. column = i, row = j. The hero arrives at (5,10) facing NE; the door BEHIND him (5,11) is a solid NPC that appears when league_run is set;
# the champion stands at (5,4) facing SW; his script is the ending (Hall of Legacy, the credits, the save at home, back to the title). No door ahead, no warp.
@map liga_campeon
@size 11 12
@interior yes
@bg 0
@fill marb_00
@spawn in 5 10 NE
@var champ_st 5          # (contract 80): the player's starter species (choose_starter), read by the script champ
@legend
  K  tile=none object=wall_corner
  w  tile=none object=ban_j
  |  tile=none object=ban_i
  0  tile=marb_11 
  1  tile=marb_01 
  2  tile=marb_10 
  3  tile=marb_00 
  4  tile=marb_01 object=cpil
  5  tile=marb_10 npc=rival_s id=champ face=SW script=champ
  6  tile=marb_10 object=troph
  7  tile=marb_00 object=cpil
  8  tile=marb_11 npc=keydoor id=door_x face=S solid=yes gate=yes text=gl.c9.door.shut show_flag=league_run
@grid
  Kwwwwwwwwww
  |0101010101
  |2323232323
  |0401010401
  |2323532323
  |0101010101
  |6323232363
  |0101010101
  |2723232723
  |0101010101
  |2323232323
  |0101810101
# The champion. The fight, then the ending: Lin's words, the Hall of Legacy -> the record -> the save at home -> the credits (all inside `ending run`), then back to the
# title (`ending title`, resident). A defeat is the blackout (the lobby, the run flags cleared). Afterwards (a rematch after the Hall of Legacy: the run flags are cleared by the ending) he says one line.
@script champ npc
    jf league_champ again
    npc_face_hero champ
    say lg.champ.pre
    # (contract 80): sends the rival's starter LAST: the team is fixed in each of three trainers (his ace, the last form of the line that beats the player's starter, is the last slot), so the player's starter picks the entry
    choose_starter champ_st
    jv champ_st sp:embercub champ_e
    jv champ_st sp:puddlet champ_p
    battle rival_liga 0               # the player took Sprouton: the rival's ace is Pyrewolf
    jmp fought
  champ_e:
    battle rival_liga_e 0             # Embercub: Tidalgard
    jmp fought
  champ_p:
    battle rival_liga_p 0             # Puddlet: Grovestag
  fought:
    jv 0 1 won
    blackout
    end
  won:
    setf league_champ
    say lg.champ.win
    say lg.champ.lin
    jf frag_8 end_run
    say d1.champ.frag
    give_item origin_shard 1
    jv 0 0 end_run
    setf frag_8
    sfx item
    say gl.d1.got
  end_run:
    ending run 1
    jv 1 0 fail
    ending title
    end
  fail:
    say gl.c9.end.fail
    end
  again:
    npc_face_hero champ
    say lg.champ.after
@end
